<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-ENGLAND A BEAT ARGENTINA 22-17.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ENGLAND A BEAT ARGENTINA 22-17.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHAMPTON, England 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>England A beat</p>
<p>Argentina 22-17 (halftime 9-5) in a rugby union tour match on</p>
<p>Tuesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>England A - Tries: Hackney, Conversion: Grayson. Penalties:</p>
<p>Grayson (5)</p>
<p>Argentina - Tries: Hassan, Soler. Penalty try: Soler.</p>
<p>Conversion: Cilley.</p>
</text>
